<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Land 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Ayala Land 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>					  (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues			  12,416.2    vs   10,128.9</p>
<p>    Costs				7,653.4    vs    6,868.3</p>
<p>    Minority interests (net)	 752.5    vs	152.5</p>
<p>    Net Income			 4,010.4    vs    3,108.1</p>
<p>Note: Ayala Land Inc is a unit of Ayala Corp. 1996 figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 8418934</p>
</text>
